Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Workflow Jobs Not Executing in Order
Problem: Jobs execute simultaneously instead of sequentially

Solution:

Verify that job dependencies are properly configured in the Workflow Visualizer
Ensure that success/failure conditions are set correctly
Check that there are no circular dependencies in the workflow
Issue 2: Conditional Logic Not Working
Problem: Failure paths don't execute when jobs fail

Solution:

Confirm that failure conditions are configured (On Failure, not just On Success)
Verify that job templates are configured to fail appropriately
Check that the workflow template has the correct node connections
Issue 3: Variables Not Passing Between Jobs
Problem: Job templates can't access workflow variables

Solution:

Ensure variables are defined at the workflow template level
Use the correct variable syntax in job template playbooks
Verify that extra variables are enabled in job templates
Issue 4: Workflow Hangs or Doesn't Complete
Problem: Workflow execution stops unexpectedly

Solution:

Check individual job logs for errors
Verify that all required credentials are available
Ensure target hosts are accessible
Review workflow node configurations for missing connections
